{"id":"447901","name":"冬瓜仙贝汤","author":"满宝妈妈","authorId":"9118742","desc":"","cover":"images/447901/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"冬瓜","amount":"一块"},{"name":"鲜贝","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"食用油","amount":"两勺"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"一小勺"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"几粒"},{"name":"盐","amount":"少许"},{"name":"香油","amount":"几滴"},{"name":"清水","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"冬瓜去皮去籽切成切片，鲜贝肉洗净备用。","img":"images/447901/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"锅中加两勺食用油烧热，放入提前切好的葱花爆香。","img":"images/447901/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"向锅中加入适量清水。","img":"images/447901/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"向锅中放入冬瓜片和鲜贝肉。","img":"images/447901/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加点鸡精。","img":"images/447901/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加一点生抽。","img":"images/447901/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"煮沸后继续中火加热十五到二十分钟，加少许盐。","img":"images/447901/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"关火加几滴香油。","img":"images/447901/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"出锅装盘就可以了。","img":"images/447901/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}